{"id":"kritik","lemma":"Kritik","pos":"noun","rank":4494,"glosses":["criticism (negative judgement)","criticism, review (general judgement)","critique, review (review of a work of art)"],"ipa":"/kʁiˈtiːk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/De-Kritik.ogg/De-Kritik.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Kritik","plural":"Kritiken"},"examples":[{"text":"Deine Kritik ist ungerecht.","en":"Your criticism is unfair.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567066","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"unjust, unfair"}]},{"text":"Nicht alle Kritik ist konstruktiv.","en":"Not all criticism is constructive.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"constructive"}]},{"text":"Sein Buch zog Kritik auf sich.","en":"His book became an object of criticism.","words":[{"g":"to be"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},{"g":"to pull","l":"ziehen"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"oneself"}]},{"text":"Du setzt dich zahlreicher Kritik aus.","en":"You're exposing yourself to a lot of criticism.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to sit down","l":"setzen"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null,null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Das wird viel Kritik hervorrufen.","en":"That'll cause a lot of criticism.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"much, a lot"},null,{"g":"to arouse"}]}]}